  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "創新與服務設計",
    "sub_ename": "INNOVATION AND SERVICE DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在引導學生深入了解創新與服務設計的核心概念與原則，透過創新的概念探索設計思維、用戶中心設計和服務設計流程等內容，學生將學會如何運用創新方法與設計思維解決現實世界的問題。內容包含有服務市場的創新的來源與機會、創新的類型、消費行為、服務設計、用戶需求管理、服務現場管理、服務溝通組合、服務定價與遞送與社會創新…等。同時運用設計思考流程，並輔以相關產業的實際個案，協助學生能應用於自身產業與開發流程中，改善服務提供者與客戶之間的互動與溝通，進而發掘創新商機。",
    "describe_eh": "The main purpose of this course is to enable students to understand the concept of innovation management and service design planning from the customer side, including sources and opportunities of innovation, types and patterns of innovation, consumer behavior, service design, customer demand management, field service management, communication mix in service, service pricing and delivery, and social innovation. Also, using the design thinking process and real cases to help students apply to their own business and development processes, improving the interaction and communication between service providers and customers, and then exploring new opportunities.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
